{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ropes\/rope"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ropes\/SK","doc:\/\/Ropes\/Sl","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/SQ","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s25ExpressibleByArrayLiteralP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/SH","doc:\/\/Ropes\/SM","doc:\/\/Ropes\/Sk","doc:\/\/Ropes\/Sm","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/ST"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A rope: a sequence stored as a balanced tree of chunks, so inserting, removing or replacing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements anywhere costs O(log "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":") plus the elements moved within one chunk, rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":") an array spends shifting everything after the edit."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes"]]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Operators","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes\/Rope\/+(_:_:)"],"anchor":"Operators"},{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes\/Rope\/init()"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes\/Rope\/count"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes\/Rope\/append(contentsOf:)-35700","doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes\/Rope\/extracting(_:)","doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes\/Rope\/insert(_:at:)","doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes\/Rope\/insert